OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over suspected
OL,4,Ahit-and-run death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court after a
OL,7,Fpedestrian died following a suspected
OL,8,Fhit-and-run.
OL,10,FHumberside Police received reports of a
OL,11,Fcar hitting a pedestrian on 31 October
OL,12,Fon Park Street, Hull, at about 17:30
OL,13,FGMT.
OL,15,FThe force said 67-year-old Steve Cook
OL,16,Fwas taken to hospital where he died the
OL,17,Fnext morning.
OL,19,FTenerif Constantin, 21, appeared at
OL,20,FHull Magistrates' Court on Tuesday
OL,21,Fcharged with causing death by careless
OL,22,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
